{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"high-contrast-dark","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"High Contrast Dark","description":"Strong contrast and bright colors that meet the WCAG AAA ratio.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"High Contrast Dark","path":"themes/high-contrast-dark.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/high-contrast-dark.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"High Contrast Dark\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#000000\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#0a0a0a\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#000000\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#000000\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#0a0a0a\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#1a1a1a\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#264f78\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#000000\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#0a0a0a\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#6fc3df\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#f38518\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#f38518\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#f38518\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#264f78\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#1a1a1a80\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#f38518\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#6fc3df\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#f48771\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#6dd36d\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#e2c08d\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f48771\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#7ca668\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ce9178\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#b5cea8\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#569cd6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4ec9b0\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#dcdcaa\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#4fc1ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9cdcfe\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#569cd6\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#9cdcfe\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c586c0\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# High Contrast Dark\n\nStrong contrast and bright colors that meet the WCAG AAA ratio.\n\nInstall it, then pick **High Contrast Dark** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nAn original palette by Vyloxi, designed for accessibility.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#000000` |\n| Text | `#ffffff` |\n| Accent | `#f38518` |\n| Keywords | `#569cd6` |\n| Strings | `#ce9178` |\n| Functions | `#dcdcaa` |\n| Types | `#4ec9b0` |\n| Comments | `#7ca668` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}